  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the VRChat 0.12.0p16 build number 532 release; Animations (whether Emote Animations, or animations on Avatars) have become Broken; Emote Animations will Freeze your character in place (client-side; other players still see the animation play) disabling you until  the \"animation cycle\" completes, releasing you to move around normally.  For Avatar Animations (models with animations on them) they will reset the animation at any random moment, (possibly when another player in the world changes their model or otherwise, the cause/trigger is unknown). This issue did not exist before this current update.",
